@startuml
title Authorisation of an asset-referenced token issuer (Articles 18 to 21)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF4F4
  ParticipantBorderColor #2F6F73
  LifeLineBorderColor #2F6F73
  ArrowColor #2F6F73
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2F6F73
}
participant "Applicant issuer\n(EU legal person)" as Iss
participant "Home competent\nauthority" as NCA
participant "EBA and ESMA" as ESA
participant "ECB or national\ncentral bank" as ECB

Iss -> NCA : Application (Art. 18): LEI, business plan,\nlegal opinion, governance, white paper, plans
NCA -> Iss : Completeness check within 25 working days
NCA -> NCA : Assessment within 60 working days\n(one suspension of at most 20 working days)
NCA -> ESA : Draft decision and application (Art. 20(4))
NCA -> ECB : Draft decision and application
ESA --> NCA : Opinion on the classification\nlegal opinion, 20 working days (non-binding)
ECB --> NCA : Opinion on financial stability, payment\nsystems, monetary policy, 20 working days
note over NCA, ECB
  A negative central-bank opinion on payment
  systems, monetary policy transmission or
  monetary sovereignty obliges a refusal (Art. 21(4))
end note
NCA -> Iss : Reasoned decision within 25 working days\nof the opinions; notified within 5 (Art. 21(1))
NCA -> ESA : Authorisation communicated to ESMA\nfor the Art. 109 register
note over Iss
  Authorisation valid across the Union;
  the white paper is deemed approved
end note
@enduml
